{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8e1810f48d60bf745771bdfc5d3b820c2c8e1511a99947a67557c6ec10ea0b1a", "ja": "（ついに765プロ劇場の初公演の日がやってきた。\n当たり前だけど、少し空気が張り詰めてるな……）", "zh": "（765艺能剧场首次公演的日子终于到了。\n会紧张很正常，但气氛难免有些凝重……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "667d960927835bae5f34aa10876c0cc1b5f7401a11bc8830b00cb70453bfcbe2", "ja": "うう、大丈夫かな？\nやっぱり今からでも……。", "zh": "呜呜，真的行吗？\n还是干脆点，现在就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "53575b5dd0821d4eb4fb9d1382c10cec26a58bbbe5bc918658600468cf1f24b3", "ja": "やよい？\nどうしたんだ、出番はまだのはずだろう？", "zh": "弥生？\n你怎么了？还没轮到你上台吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "4f9ae6e97047a1c6564fc2b65738391d2f622ed1865ad8ab2d541a4df84bb1e0", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\nええと、ちょっと落ち着かなくて……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n这个，我有点坐不住……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bd47339c26c1af4b167475d8004d4454cf5763db4e2624bbe5f275017a92d8a5", "ja": "たしかに、今日は765プロ劇場の初公演だ。\nライブ経験のあるやよいでも、緊張するか……。", "zh": "这也难怪，今天是765艺能剧场的首次公演。\n弥生虽然有演唱会的经验，但还是会紧张呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "a666ae94dd8a4dfeeac4978aa3ac3b92c482634dbabec8057ba999fec60e1a26", "ja": "いえ、違いますっ。胸はドキドキしてますけど、\nそこまで緊張してるってわけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "啊，你误会了。我的心虽然扑通扑通跳得好快，\n但没有紧张到那个程度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3f245db25f33ff9198fe681f7bd886bc97ff9221019100782546e0989ef08fe6", "ja": "なら、なんで落ち着かないんだ？", "zh": "那你坐不住的原因是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "facc0f649ff9007401613b27cc4b4d869848a02b92cea40a4362d96497dd76ea", "ja": "みんなのことが心配なんです。\nだから、じっとしてられなくて……。", "zh": "我很担心大家，\n所以一直坐立难安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "8ea2ace8a8ee7bebd50593dc486d23192fd7b6f471178ce841def791a1514609", "ja": "衣装ちゃんと着れたかなーとか、靴ずれしてないかなー\nとか、どんどん不安に……。", "zh": "想说服装有没有穿好～鞋子合不合脚～之类的，\n想着想着就越来越担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "0264278865d573a8679bc77fd6ea87a862675c5b1b1c175c46bdb274c24fed7e", "ja": "ハンカチとちり紙、ちゃんと持ってるかな……\nうう、やっぱり心配かも～。", "zh": "还有手帕跟卫生纸有没有带着……\n呜呜，我真的好担心喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "3f28005a509f453a3e9a9c31376011d0715cb111c0a3e91a05a1b2ac720cbf6b", "ja": "{$P$}、私、\nちょっとみんなの所へ行ってきますー！", "zh": "{$P$}，\n我去大家那边看看──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "51ed33dd8d0bf07965b15de5264fec55c65c6be6bd03e2b1f14c9aa73195b347", "ja": "待て、やよい！\n大丈夫だから、いったん落ち着こうか。", "zh": "等等，弥生！\n没事的，你先冷静一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "c2e1fffe68e515c716294990c9af911ba6f52bf0695cfc0a89317e8a77eeb594", "ja": "で、でも～。", "zh": "可、可是～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1013_p", "source_sha256": "24ccce53c6908f8c5ed61741539bbccc568920f9410627aaab4fd8d258be288f", "ja": "やよい。後輩を心配するその気持ちもわかる。", "zh": "弥生，我能明白你担心新人的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2fcfaa5b8a80be9b47c45049499caa8ec5304399677b0390a27f956a672a13c0", "ja": "だけど、1度ステージに立てば、みんな1人のアイドル\nとして、自分の力で何とかするしかなくなるんだ。", "zh": "可是，一旦站上了舞台，大家都得成为\n独当一面的偶像，靠自己跨过难关才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "2b1c2f73204700964f158c0b1394f7712ec0b402535dd2655491bf45a386ec9e", "ja": "自分の力で……。", "zh": "靠自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1016_p", "source_sha256": "08502c156716dbc6f82b9df4ad3ba2ecc09f109ccdfa1fcb9edc910febf97ccd", "ja": "そう。だから、みんなをアイドルとして信じよう。\n信じた上で、やよいには今やるべきことがある。", "zh": "没错，所以你就相信身为偶像的她们吧。\n给予她们信任，再完成弥生你现在该做的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "ed986dba1e798f9243465d6d90762ae4ff7905e362d0cbcbb7f9b3b58cd13c0f", "ja": "私がやるべきこと……ですか？", "zh": "我该做的事情……是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e8c143ff8e189d416cbafe09a4deee8e76902d749665a4193d093459ab1a1a05", "ja": "同じ1人のアイドルとして、劇場を盛り上げることだ！", "zh": "就是同样以偶像的身分，活跃剧场的气氛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e77fe1174b63592404b2a4f19826411ec9057c0653b1690f04b579d86e5fd398", "ja": "みんなが、なんの心配なくステージに飛び出していける\nように、目いっぱい劇場を盛り上げてくれ！", "zh": "为了让大家可以放心跳上舞台演出，\n你要尽全力让剧场的观众嗨起来才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "86816c8cd0214fc4318d8b81742717bf7c6457e37d7d455f4f17419d6dfb0d37", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nそっか、そうですよね！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n对耶，你说得对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "fbc8d390e2e57b2471bf2462a9144fb7cd98d2b475a1162468e64e1eeb9bd1d1", "ja": "わかりましたっ。私、みんなが安心して元気よく\n飛び出せるように、いっぱい盛り上げて来ますっ！", "zh": "我知道了！为了让大家可以放心带着活力上台，\n我会用全力活跃气氛的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a84f94955397108633e958b84a9c09f1a81d1fe11f96194f4bdd93a36585ed21", "ja": "その調子だ、やよい。\nやよいの格好いいところを見せてやれ！", "zh": "就是这样，弥生。\n让大家瞧瞧你帅气的一面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "612e85ae508caff492c179012d6edbce834b98aae389a8fe162ec9629a08cf28", "ja": "はいっ！　それじゃあ、\nいっぱい盛り上げるって約束の～……", "zh": "遵命！那么，\n要活跃气氛可不能少了这个～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1024_005yay", "source_sha256": "c4f64d52c653924cf43cfe3b906c0fbab027b4cb23644b6a8cbb7e93d6e30a80", "ja": "ハイ、ターッチ！", "zh": "好，击──掌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_1025", "source_sha256": "84c29e7000290de00eaf61887e7ab5f7a175ed6d7a15577b604d361cb5338884", "ja": "ハイタッチ！", "zh": "好，击掌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_2000_005yay", "source_sha256": "21a6e6fb62b3b2d938057454d1fe833f818bc5c5e9b762de1a67a86aa4b101f3", "ja": "いぇい！\n{$P$}、行ってきまーす！", "zh": "耶！\n{$P$}，我上场啰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_003_2001_p", "source_sha256": "11eec4252acde3a163e4547f353b494885a7b06a48558881369f3b1afeec06e2", "ja": "（眩しい笑顔と共に、やよいはステージに\n飛び出していく。輝くアイドルの一人として！）", "zh": "（弥生带着灿烂的笑容跳上舞台，\n展现了偶像的耀眼光芒！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
